{"type":"data","nodes":[{"type":"data","data":[{"categories":1,"event_categories":27},[2,9,15,21],{"id":3,"attributes":4},1,{"slug":5,"name":6,"description":7,"createdAt":8,"updatedAt":8},"nutrition","營養隨筆",null,"2023-02-12T02:39:02.691Z",{"id":10,"attributes":11},2,{"slug":12,"name":13,"description":7,"createdAt":14,"updatedAt":14},"reflection","感悟隨筆","2023-02-12T02:39:02.692Z",{"id":16,"attributes":17},3,{"slug":18,"name":19,"description":7,"createdAt":20,"updatedAt":20},"fitness","運動筆記","2023-02-12T02:39:02.697Z",{"id":22,"attributes":23},4,{"slug":24,"name":25,"description":7,"createdAt":26,"updatedAt":26},"spiritual","心靈勵志","2023-02-12T02:39:02.698Z",[28,33,38,43,47,52,58],{"id":3,"attributes":29},{"name":30,"slug":31,"description":7,"createdAt":32,"updatedAt":32},"讀書會","book-sharing","2023-02-12T02:38:55.939Z",{"id":16,"attributes":34},{"name":35,"slug":36,"description":7,"createdAt":37,"updatedAt":37},"文化導賞","cultural","2023-02-12T02:38:55.943Z",{"id":22,"attributes":39},{"name":40,"slug":41,"description":7,"createdAt":42,"updatedAt":42},"遊山玩水","hiking","2023-02-12T02:38:55.946Z",{"id":44,"attributes":45},5,{"name":46,"slug":18,"description":7,"createdAt":42,"updatedAt":42},"健體運動",{"id":48,"attributes":49},6,{"name":50,"slug":5,"description":7,"createdAt":51,"updatedAt":51},"活學營養","2023-02-12T02:38:55.947Z",{"id":10,"attributes":53},{"name":54,"slug":55,"description":7,"createdAt":56,"updatedAt":57},"名人面對面","be-our-guest","2023-02-12T02:38:55.942Z","2023-03-08T13:16:12.875Z",{"id":59,"attributes":60},8,{"name":61,"slug":62,"description":7,"createdAt":63,"updatedAt":63},"每周恆常活動","weekly_activity","2025-12-23T03:48:29.472Z"],"uses":{"dependencies":["http://127.0.0.1:1337/api/categories?","http://127.0.0.1:1337/api/event-categories?"]},"slash":"always"},{"type":"data","data":[{"id":1,"attributes":2},271,{"title":3,"excerpt":4,"content":5,"slug":6,"createdAt":7,"updatedAt":7,"author":8,"categories":9,"tags":17,"image":19,"related_posts":57},"腸癌年輕化！為腸道建構3重防護牆",null,"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E腸道是人體最大的免疫器官，也是癌症發生的高危區。近年，大腸癌發病率逐年上升，是香港第三大最常見癌症，在內地是第二高發惡性腫瘤。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E科學研究發現，我們熟悉的鈣元素，原來在腸道中發揮遠超想像的作用，為腸道築起「3重防護墻」：\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E1. 物理屏障：攔截致癌物的第一道防線\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E腸道中的膽汁酸在消化脂肪時可轉化為次級膽汁酸，刺激腸壁細胞異常增生。鈣離子能與膽汁酸結合形成不溶性複合物，直接減少致癌物對腸道的刺激。美國《癌症研究》期刊指出，每日攝入1000毫克鈣，可使腸道次級膽汁酸濃度降低37%。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E2. 生化屏障：精準調控細胞生長信號\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E腸道上皮細胞每3至5天更新一次，若增殖失控可誘發癌變。鈣離子通過激活鈣敏感受體，抑制致癌的信號通路。2023年《細胞》期刊研究發現，鈣攝入量每日超過1000毫克的人士，腸道抑癌因子水平提升42%。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E3. 免疫屏障：訓練腸道免疫部隊\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E腸道中70%的免疫細胞需要鈣離子激活。鈣能促進調節性T細胞分化，這些細胞如同「和平使者」，可防止免疫系統過度攻擊腸道組織。研究顯示，低鈣飲食人士（每日低於600毫克）的腸道瘜肉增生風險增加1.8倍。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E鈣攝入足夠嗎？代謝有否異常？\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E根據世界衛生組織，成年人每日鈣推薦攝入量為1000毫克，但香港人日均鈣攝入量僅為430毫克，不到推薦攝入量的一半。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E長期便秘或腹瀉可能提示鈣吸收障礙；指甲脆弱易斷、夜間小腿抽筋等症狀，往往與鈣代謝失衡相關。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E營養協同 構建防癌網絡\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E要達致更佳的防癌效果，鈣須與其他營養素配合。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E鎂和維他命D在促進鈣吸收和骨骼礦化過程中起關鍵作用；若鎂和維他命D不足，即使攝入了足量的鈣，身體也無法有效吸收。深綠色蔬菜和堅果富含鎂，深海魚類（如三文魚、沙甸魚）及蛋黃含較高的維他命D，但這些食物的攝入量通常不足以滿足日常需求。為提高吸收效率，建議補充含有鈣、鎂及維他命D的天然營養補充品。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E腸道菌群的健康與癌症風險密切相關。益生菌能幫助維持菌群平衡，增強腸道屏障功能，防止有害物質進入血液，減少慢性炎症，有助降低大腸癌的發病率；當中嗜酸乳桿菌和乳雙歧桿菌還能分解食物中的致癌物，減少其對腸壁的刺激。選擇益生菌時，應注意菌株的精準性、活菌數量和穩定性，確保益生菌能定殖腸道，繼續繁殖，發揮最大功效。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E此外，還應注重膳食纖維、蛋白質及維他命C的攝取，全部面守護腸道健康。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","Colorectal_cancer","2025-09-14T07:27:08.210Z",{"data":4},{"data":10},[11],{"id":12,"attributes":13},1,{"slug":14,"name":15,"description":4,"createdAt":16,"updatedAt":16},"nutrition","營養隨筆","2023-02-12T02:39:02.691Z",{"data":18},[],{"data":20},{"id":21,"attributes":22},72,{"name":23,"alternativeText":4,"caption":4,"width":24,"height":24,"formats":25,"hash":52,"ext":27,"mime":30,"size":53,"url":54,"previewUrl":4,"provider":55,"provider_metadata":4,"createdAt":56,"updatedAt":56},"508080612_1128240296003671_2669250181930557680_n.jpg",1080,{"large":26,"small":34,"medium":40,"thumbnail":46},{"ext":27,"url":28,"hash":29,"mime":30,"name":31,"path":4,"size":32,"width":33,"height":33},".jpg","https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Flarge_508080612_1128240296003671_2669250181930557680_n_ff2ebafebb.jpg","large_508080612_1128240296003671_2669250181930557680_n_ff2ebafebb","image\u002Fjpeg","large_508080612_1128240296003671_2669250181930557680_n.jpg",89.73,1000,{"ext":27,"url":35,"hash":36,"mime":30,"name":37,"path":4,"size":38,"width":39,"height":39},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fsmall_508080612_1128240296003671_2669250181930557680_n_ff2ebafebb.jpg","small_508080612_1128240296003671_2669250181930557680_n_ff2ebafebb","small_508080612_1128240296003671_2669250181930557680_n.jpg",36.9,500,{"ext":27,"url":41,"hash":42,"mime":30,"name":43,"path":4,"size":44,"width":45,"height":45},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fmedium_508080612_1128240296003671_2669250181930557680_n_ff2ebafebb.jpg","medium_508080612_1128240296003671_2669250181930557680_n_ff2ebafebb","medium_508080612_1128240296003671_2669250181930557680_n.jpg",61.1,750,{"ext":27,"url":47,"hash":48,"mime":30,"name":49,"path":4,"size":50,"width":51,"height":51},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fthumbnail_508080612_1128240296003671_2669250181930557680_n_ff2ebafebb.jpg","thumbnail_508080612_1128240296003671_2669250181930557680_n_ff2ebafebb","thumbnail_508080612_1128240296003671_2669250181930557680_n.jpg",7.08,156,"508080612_1128240296003671_2669250181930557680_n_ff2ebafebb",87.72,"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002F508080612_1128240296003671_2669250181930557680_n_ff2ebafebb.jpg","aws-s3","2025-09-14T07:24:33.894Z",{"data":58},[59,66,73],{"id":60,"attributes":61},264,{"title":62,"excerpt":4,"content":63,"slug":64,"createdAt":65,"updatedAt":65},"腸相決定長相","\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E人的腸道有5至6米長，平均每隔3.5厘米就有一個彎折。即使每天排便，也總有一些食物殘渣積滯在腸道的皺褶，在細菌的作用下腐壞，並牢牢地黏連在腸壁上，形成惡臭的有毒物質，即我們所講的宿便。研究指出，即使每天有1至3次正常排便，人體依然會有1至3公斤宿便。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E去年8月，浙江省杭州一間醫院公佈一個病例，一名53歲的女子阿花（化名）長期便祕，最近5年情況尤為嚴重，平均5至6天才得以順利排便一次，入院前更是已便秘10天，肚皮因宿便隆起，結果醫生從她的腸子取出近20公斤的糞便，相當於一條巨大的蟒蛇。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E所謂「腸相決定長相」，若排便不暢或便秘，容易皮膚暗黃，臉上長暗瘡或色斑，常有口氣甚至口臭，而最明顯就是腹部脹滿，即是身形瘦削，腹部仍是圓圓的。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E身體是最好的醫生，食物是最好的藥物，腸道是如何保護我們的健康，又有甚麼營養素是保護腸道的呢？\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E1. 益生菌\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E益生菌會吃掉腸道的酸性物質，產生維他命B，所以腸道消化功能好，是由益生菌來決定的。益生菌吃掉酸性物質的同時，會產生一個副產物「包膜」。包膜就像包火腿、香腸的膜那樣，可以包裹食物殘渣，形成大便掉到馬桶，不會散掉。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E如果大便掉到馬桶是散掉的，反映腸道菌群不大健康，壞菌有點偏多；若大便不成形或拉稀的話，代表腸道菌群的壞菌就更多了。所以鼓勵大家每天花點時間，看看自己的大便，查看一下腸道內的狀況。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E2. 膳食纖維\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E膳食纖維分為水溶性與非水溶性兩大類。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E水溶性纖維可以在水果，以及黏滑食物如秋葵、木耳、海帶中找到。它是益生元，是最有利於益生菌定植的營養素。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E非水溶性纖維則在蔬菜、牛蒡、豆類等找到，可以吸附腸道的酸性物質，結合食物殘渣形成大便，同時也可以吸附腸內的重金屬。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E無法被小腸吸收的膳食纖維會在大腸裡被益生菌分解，產生短鏈脂肪酸，為肌肉、腎臟、心臟、腦部提供能量。所以，我們一定要注意每天纖維的攝取量應至少達到25克。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E3. 水\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E身體70%都是水，而消化系統的水份是從大腸回收的。如果身體缺水，回收的水份就要增加，從而容易引發便秘。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E鼓勵大家每天喝至少2.4公升好水。好水是指去蕪存菁的食水：濾淨重金屬、藥物等污染物、已殺滅細菌病毒、保留鈣、鎂等礦物質且含氧量高的水。飲用好水能夠大大減輕肝腎的負擔，這樣才可以提升身體整體健康。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E4. 鈣、鎂\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E腸道蠕動需要礦物質鈣、鎂來幫忙完成傳遞信號，繼而進行排便。若大便到達肛門前，我們沒有排便感知，肛門的開關就不會打開，這樣就會形成便秘。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E缺鈣缺鎂，還會感覺肚脹，有下墜感，可是就是排不出便。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E大便長期停留在腸道中，會被壞菌發酵，形成毒素進入血液，到達肝臟，並容易導致瘜肉產生。故此鈣、鎂不足是腸道瘜肉的元兇。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E5. 蛋白質\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E最後，當然不得不提細胞的主要原材料 — 蛋白質。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E相對植物性蛋白質，乳製品和肉類等動物性蛋白質較易引致腸道發炎，故此建議每天蛋白質攝入至少一半應來自植物，例如豆類、芝麻、南瓜籽。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E蛋白質配合維他命C，可合成膠原蛋白，有助滋養並修復受損的細胞壁，緩解腸漏症。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","intestine_health","2024-11-03T03:30:23.354Z",{"id":67,"attributes":68},162,{"title":69,"excerpt":4,"content":70,"slug":71,"createdAt":72,"updatedAt":72},"保腸保命保健康","\n\n不少人都知道，70%免疫細胞在腸道生成；這些免疫細胞的防禦作戰能力🤺，決定了能否阻擋細菌病毒進入體內肆虐。\n\n腸道的神經系統有1億以上的神經細胞🤯，透過迷走神經影響全身的器官，包括大腦。\n\n被譽為快樂荷爾蒙的血清素😄，95%居住在腸道，與我們的睡眠、食慾、喜怒哀樂息息相關。\n\n連血液的品質，也是由腸道決定😱。唯有優質的血液可以被充份運送到身體每個細胞，我們才能享受真正的健康。\n\n由此可見，腸道並不單單是垃圾車，把人體代謝出來的廢棄物收走，更是守護我們健康的堅固長城💪🏻💪🏻。\n\n未來兩星期我們將講解如何透過調整飲食營養與生活習慣，全面提升腸道健康，讓我們百毒不侵，頭腦靈活，心境舒暢🤗！","post200313","2020-03-13T00:00:00.000Z",{"id":74,"attributes":75},168,{"title":76,"excerpt":4,"content":77,"slug":78,"createdAt":79,"updatedAt":79},"腸道健康與睡眠息息相關","\n\n有人體「第二大腦🧠」之稱的腸道，不僅是人體7成以上免疫細胞的聚集地方，腸道的微生物更影響我們的睡眠周期💤。\n\n腸道的微生物能透過免疫調節通道、神經內分泌通道和迷走神經通道與大腦交流，並通過這雙向交流🔛的\"腸道 -- 大腦軸\"來調節我們的睡眠周期、睡眠質量及睡眠時間。\n\n研究發現，若腸道內的微生物菌叢種類越多，睡眠質量與時間也越好。\n\n若果我們改變睡眠時間，便會干擾我們的生物鐘，從而改變腸道微生物群的組成比例與健康狀況。若我們因壓力、時差、捱夜等而導致睡眠不足或睡眠質素下降，這樣會破壞腸道內微生物的生態，從而影響我們整體的健康狀況。\n\n同樣，若我們經常進食高脂高糖食物，常服抗生素或壓力過大，也會導致腸道的微生物失衡，不單影響自身的免疫力，也影響我們的睡眠質量。\n\n✅研究顯示，若我們以植物性餐膳為主，並進食優質碳水化合物、高纖維、低飽和脂肪的食物，可以減低我們晚上睡眠時醒來的次數，且延長深層睡眠的時間。\n\n若要提升睡眠質量，大家也可以從腸道入手，改善飲食🥗。如前一篇貼文所分享：\u003Cbr\u003E\n- 不要胡亂服用抗生素，以免破壞腸道益菌\u003Cbr\u003E\n- 多吃蔬果及其他高纖食物，有助增加腸道益菌\u003Cbr\u003E\n- 少吃含添加劑的食物和加工食品，因添加劑會破壞腸道益菌，引致腸道發炎，更可能導致肥胖或炎症性腸病\u003Cbr\u003E\n- 適量補充益生菌，但必須注意菌株和菌種，以及能否有效黏附於腸道細胞上，單看宣稱的益菌數量意義不大","post200403","2020-04-03T00:00:00.000Z"],"uses":{"dependencies":["http://127.0.0.1:1337/api/posts?populate[author]=true&populate[categories]=true&populate[tags]=true&populate[image]=true&populate[related_posts]=true&filters[slug][$eq]=Colorectal_cancer"],"params":["slug"]}}]}